.TH wrt 1
.SH NAME
wrt - execute my usual git workflow for a project in 42

.SH SYNOPSYS
wrt [MESSAGE]

.SH DESCRIPTION
1. Check for 42 submitting requirements (like adding a README.md and norminette)
2. Delete all output files (guaranteed to clean everything up if used with cpl(1))
3. Stage for commit all files in the directory, commit them with the message provided (or a standard one)
4. Push to remote.

